### Recently Viewed Products API Tests

# Add product to recently viewed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/recently-viewed
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}"
}

###

# Get recently viewed products (default limit: 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/recently-viewed
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

# Get recently viewed products with custom limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/recently-viewed?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

# Test variables (replace with actual values)
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# @userToken = your_jwt_token_here
# @productId = actual_product_id_here
